1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
People say you have to have a lot of passion for what you're doing, and it's totally true.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
And the reason is because it's so hard that if you don't, any rational person would give up.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
It's really hard, and you have to do it over a sustained period of time.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
So if you don't love it, if you're not having fun doing it, if you don't really love it, you're going to give up.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
And that's what happens to most people, actually.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000
If you really look at the ones that ended up being successful in the eyes of society, and the ones that didn't,

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
often times the ones that are successful loved what they did, so they could persevere when it got really tough.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
And the ones that didn't love it quit. Who would want to put up with this stuff if you don't love it?

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
So it's a lot of hard work, and it's a lot of constant worry.

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000
If you don't love it, you're going to fail. So you've got to love it. You've got to have passion.

